[{"id":"waaza-4-63-9","words":["verb:waaza"],"options":[{"bs":"i opomeni ih!","en":"and admonish them!"},{"bs":"opominjem te","en":"I admonish you"},{"bs":"opominje vas","en":"he/it admonishes you (all)"},{"bs":"opominje ga","en":"he/it admonishes him"}],"ref":"4:63","answerWord":"وَعِظْهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/2d17723d585362619905.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Those are they, the secrets of whose hearts Allah knoweth. So oppose them and admonish them, and address them in plain terms about their souls.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opomenuti, savjetovati","en":"to admonish, to exhort"},"passage":["أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","يَعْلَمُ","ٱللَّهُ","مَا","فِى","قُلُوبِهِمْ","فَأَعْرِضْ","عَنْهُمْ","وَعِظْهُمْ","وَقُل","لَّهُمْ","فِىٓ","أَنفُسِهِمْ","قَوْلًۢا","بَلِيغًا"],"marked":[9],"facts":{"verb":"وَعَظَ"}},{"id":"waaza-4-66-20","words":["verb:waaza"],"options":[{"bs":"opominju se","en":"they are admonished"},{"bs":"da li si savjetovao","en":"whether you admonished"},{"bs":"opominjem vas","en":"I admonish you (all)"},{"bs":"opominjem te","en":"I admonish you"}],"ref":"4:66","answerWord":"يُوعَظُونَ","answerSound":"audio/a2b48ea29fe9990cf144.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And if We had decreed for them: Lay down your lives or go forth from your dwellings, but few of them would have done it; though if they did what they are exhorted to do it would be better for them, and more strengthening;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opomenuti, savjetovati","en":"to admonish, to exhort"},"passage":["وَلَوْ","أَنَّا","كَتَبْنَا","عَلَيْهِمْ","أَنِ","ٱقْتُلُوٓا۟","أَنفُسَكُمْ","أَوِ","ٱخْرُجُوا۟","مِن","دِيَٰرِكُم","مَّا","فَعَلُوهُ","إِلَّا","قَلِيلٌ","مِّنْهُمْ","وَلَوْ","أَنَّهُمْ","فَعَلُوا۟","مَا","يُوعَظُونَ","بِهِۦ","لَكَانَ","خَيْرًا","لَّهُمْ","وَأَشَدَّ","تَثْبِيتًا"],"marked":[20],"facts":{"verb":"وَعَظَ"}},{"id":"waaza-7-164-5","words":["verb:waaza"],"options":[{"bs":"opominjete","en":"you (all) admonish"},{"bs":"i opomeni ih!","en":"and admonish them!"},{"bs":"da li si savjetovao","en":"whether you admonished"},{"bs":"opominje vas","en":"he/it admonishes you (all)"}],"ref":"7:164","answerWord":"تَعِظُونَ","answerSound":"audio/7c69bb7c27e05a37d2ca.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when a community among them said: Why preach ye to a folk whom Allah is about to destroy or punish with an awful doom, they said: In order to be free from guilt before your Lord, and that haply they may ward off (evil).","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opomenuti, savjetovati","en":"to admonish, to exhort"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","قَالَتْ","أُمَّةٌ","مِّنْهُمْ","لِمَ","تَعِظُونَ","قَوْمًا","ٱللَّهُ","مُهْلِكُهُمْ","أَوْ","مُعَذِّبُهُمْ","عَذَابًا","شَدِيدًا","قَالُوا۟","مَعْذِرَةً","إِلَىٰ","رَبِّكُمْ","وَلَعَلَّهُمْ","يَتَّقُونَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"وَعَظَ"}},{"id":"waaza-11-46-18","words":["verb:waaza"],"options":[{"bs":"opominjem te","en":"I admonish you"},{"bs":"opominje ga","en":"he/it admonishes him"},{"bs":"bivate opomenuti","en":"you (all) are admonished"},{"bs":"opominju se","en":"they are admonished"}],"ref":"11:46","answerWord":"أَعِظُكَ","answerSound":"audio/f972eb7b0a7fc6d17366.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: O Noah! Lo! he is not of thy household; lo! he is of evil conduct, so ask not of Me that whereof thou hast no knowledge. I admonish thee lest thou be among the ignorant.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opomenuti, savjetovati","en":"to admonish, to exhort"},"passage":["قَالَ","يَٰنُوحُ","إِنَّهُۥ","لَيْسَ","مِنْ","أَهْلِكَ","إِنَّهُۥ","عَمَلٌ","غَيْرُ","صَٰلِحٍ","فَلَا","تَسْـَٔلْنِ","مَا","لَيْسَ","لَكَ","بِهِۦ","عِلْمٌ","إِنِّىٓ","أَعِظُكَ","أَن","تَكُونَ","مِنَ","ٱلْجَٰهِلِينَ"],"marked":[18],"facts":{"verb":"وَعَظَ"}},{"id":"waaza-16-90-13","words":["verb:waaza"],"options":[{"bs":"opominje vas","en":"he/it admonishes you (all)"},{"bs":"i opomeni ih!","en":"and admonish them!"},{"bs":"biva opomenut","en":"he/it is admonished"},{"bs":"da li si savjetovao","en":"whether you admonished"}],"ref":"16:90","answerWord":"يَعِظُكُمْ","answerSound":"audio/1e173a13e74db12c221b.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! Allah enjoineth justice and kindness, and giving to kinsfolk, and forbiddeth lewdness and abomination and wickedness. He exhorteth you in order that ye may take heed.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opomenuti, savjetovati","en":"to admonish, to exhort"},"passage":["إِنَّ","ٱللَّهَ","يَأْمُرُ","بِٱلْعَدْلِ","وَٱلْإِحْسَٰنِ","وَإِيتَآئِ","ذِى","ٱلْقُرْبَىٰ","وَيَنْهَىٰ","عَنِ","ٱلْفَحْشَآءِ","وَٱلْمُنكَرِ","وَٱلْبَغْىِ","يَعِظُكُمْ","لَعَلَّكُمْ","تَذَكَّرُونَ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"وَعَظَ"}},{"id":"waaza-26-136-3","words":["verb:waaza"],"options":[{"bs":"da li si savjetovao","en":"whether you admonished"},{"bs":"opominjete","en":"you (all) admonish"},{"bs":"i opomeni ih!","en":"and admonish them!"},{"bs":"opominje ga","en":"he/it admonishes him"}],"ref":"26:136","answerWord":"أَوَعَظْتَ","answerSound":"audio/1ca40546b3625ed7d948.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"They said: It is all one to us whether thou preachest or art not of those who preach;","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opomenuti, savjetovati","en":"to admonish, to exhort"},"passage":["قَالُوا۟","سَوَآءٌ","عَلَيْنَآ","أَوَعَظْتَ","أَمْ","لَمْ","تَكُن","مِّنَ","ٱلْوَٰعِظِينَ"],"marked":[3],"facts":{"verb":"وَعَظَ"}},{"id":"waaza-31-13-5","words":["verb:waaza"],"options":[{"bs":"opominje ga","en":"he/it admonishes him"},{"bs":"bivate opomenuti","en":"you (all) are admonished"},{"bs":"i opomeni ih!","en":"and admonish them!"},{"bs":"biva opomenut","en":"he/it is admonished"}],"ref":"31:13","answerWord":"يَعِظُهُۥ","answerSound":"audio/16151f81dbb05ab997f4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And (remember) when Luqman said unto his son, when he was exhorting him: O my dear son! Ascribe no partners unto Allah. Lo! to ascribe partners (unto Him) is a tremendous wrong -","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opomenuti, savjetovati","en":"to admonish, to exhort"},"passage":["وَإِذْ","قَالَ","لُقْمَٰنُ","لِٱبْنِهِۦ","وَهُوَ","يَعِظُهُۥ","يَٰبُنَىَّ","لَا","تُشْرِكْ","بِٱللَّهِ","إِنَّ","ٱلشِّرْكَ","لَظُلْمٌ","عَظِيمٌ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"وَعَظَ"}},{"id":"waaza-34-46-2","words":["verb:waaza"],"options":[{"bs":"opominjem vas","en":"I admonish you (all)"},{"bs":"i opomeni ih!","en":"and admonish them!"},{"bs":"opominjem te","en":"I admonish you"},{"bs":"biva opomenut","en":"he/it is admonished"}],"ref":"34:46","answerWord":"أَعِظُكُم","answerSound":"audio/bd7cca750205f1530f6d.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Say (unto them, O Muhammad): I exhort you unto one thing only: that ye awake, for Allah's sake, by twos and singly, and then reflect: There is no madness in your comrade. He is naught else than a warner unto you in face of a terrific doom.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opomenuti, savjetovati","en":"to admonish, to exhort"},"passage":["قُلْ","إِنَّمَآ","أَعِظُكُم","بِوَٰحِدَةٍ","أَن","تَقُومُوا۟","لِلَّهِ","مَثْنَىٰ","وَفُرَٰدَىٰ","ثُمَّ","تَتَفَكَّرُوا۟","مَا","بِصَاحِبِكُم","مِّن","جِنَّةٍ","إِنْ","هُوَ","إِلَّا","نَذِيرٌ","لَّكُم","بَيْنَ","يَدَىْ","عَذَابٍ","شَدِيدٍ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"وَعَظَ"}},{"id":"waaza-58-3-15","words":["verb:waaza"],"options":[{"bs":"bivate opomenuti","en":"you (all) are admonished"},{"bs":"opominjem vas","en":"I admonish you (all)"},{"bs":"i opomeni ih!","en":"and admonish them!"},{"bs":"opominje ga","en":"he/it admonishes him"}],"ref":"58:3","answerWord":"تُوعَظُونَ","answerSound":"audio/9e9c4a2eb4ef1505ebac.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Those who put away their wives (by saying they are as their mothers) and afterward would go back on that which they have said, (the penalty) in that case (is) the freeing of a slave before they touch one another. Unto this ye are exhorted; and Allah is Informed of what ye do.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"opomenuti, savjetovati","en":"to admonish, to exhort"},"passage":["وَٱلَّذِينَ","يُظَٰهِرُونَ","مِن","نِّسَآئِهِمْ","ثُمَّ","يَعُودُونَ","لِمَا","قَالُوا۟","فَتَحْرِيرُ","رَقَبَةٍ","مِّن","قَبْلِ","أَن","يَتَمَآسَّا","ذَٰلِكُمْ","تُوعَظُونَ","بِهِۦ","وَٱللَّهُ","بِمَا","تَعْمَلُونَ","خَبِيرٌ"],"marked":[15],"facts":{"verb":"وَعَظَ"}},{"id":"arada-3-11-18-8","words":["verb:arada-3"],"options":[{"bs":"izloženi su","en":"they are presented"},{"bs":"izloženi ste","en":"you (all) are presented"},{"bs":"izložen je","en":"he/it is presented"},{"bs":"i bili su izloženi","en":"and they were presented"}],"ref":"11:18","answerWord":"يُعْرَضُونَ","answerSound":"audio/eb17ef4b35f13c421509.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Who doeth greater wrong than he who inventeth a lie concerning Allah? Such will be brought before their Lord, and the witnesses will say: These are they who lied concerning their Lord. Now the curse of Allah is upon wrong-doers,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokazati, izložiti, ponuditi","en":"to show, to present, to offer"},"passage":["وَمَنْ","أَظْلَمُ","مِمَّنِ","ٱفْتَرَىٰ","عَلَى","ٱللَّهِ","كَذِبًا","أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","يُعْرَضُونَ","عَلَىٰ","رَبِّهِمْ","وَيَقُولُ","ٱلْأَشْهَٰدُ","هَٰٓؤُلَآءِ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَذَبُوا۟","عَلَىٰ","رَبِّهِمْ","أَلَا","لَعْنَةُ","ٱللَّهِ","عَلَى","ٱلظَّٰلِمِينَ"],"marked":[8],"facts":{"verb":"عَرَضَ"}},{"id":"arada-3-46-20-1","words":["verb:arada-3"],"options":[{"bs":"izložen je","en":"he/it is presented"},{"bs":"i bili su izloženi","en":"and they were presented"},{"bs":"bio je izložen","en":"he/it was presented"},{"bs":"ponudili smo","en":"we offered"}],"ref":"46:20","answerWord":"يُعْرَضُ","answerSound":"audio/5038606036b9f5708979.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And on the day when those who disbelieve are exposed to the Fire (it will be said): Ye squandered your good things in the life of the world and sought comfort therein. Now this day ye are rewarded with the doom of ignominy because ye were disdainful in the land without a right, and because ye used to transgress.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokazati, izložiti, ponuditi","en":"to show, to present, to offer"},"passage":["وَيَوْمَ","يُعْرَضُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","كَفَرُوا۟","عَلَى","ٱلنَّارِ","أَذْهَبْتُمْ","طَيِّبَٰتِكُمْ","فِى","حَيَاتِكُمُ","ٱلدُّنْيَا","وَٱسْتَمْتَعْتُم","بِهَا","فَٱلْيَوْمَ","تُجْزَوْنَ","عَذَابَ","ٱلْهُونِ","بِمَا","كُنتُمْ","تَسْتَكْبِرُونَ","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","بِغَيْرِ","ٱلْحَقِّ","وَبِمَا","كُنتُمْ","تَفْسُقُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"عَرَضَ"}},{"id":"arada-3-2-31-5","words":["verb:arada-3"],"options":[{"bs":"izložio ih je","en":"he/it presented them"},{"bs":"izložen je","en":"he/it is presented"},{"bs":"i bili su izloženi","en":"and they were presented"},{"bs":"bio je izložen","en":"he/it was presented"}],"ref":"2:31","answerWord":"عَرَضَهُمْ","answerSound":"audio/171d5a170d06691e3aab.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And He taught Adam all the names, then showed them to the angels, saying: Inform Me of the names of these, if ye are truthful.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokazati, izložiti, ponuditi","en":"to show, to present, to offer"},"passage":["وَعَلَّمَ","ءَادَمَ","ٱلْأَسْمَآءَ","كُلَّهَا","ثُمَّ","عَرَضَهُمْ","عَلَى","ٱلْمَلَٰٓئِكَةِ","فَقَالَ","أَنۢبِـُٔونِى","بِأَسْمَآءِ","هَٰٓؤُلَآءِ","إِن","كُنتُمْ","صَٰدِقِينَ"],"marked":[5],"facts":{"verb":"عَرَضَ"}},{"id":"arada-3-18-48-0","words":["verb:arada-3"],"options":[{"bs":"i bili su izloženi","en":"and they were presented"},{"bs":"izložio ih je","en":"he/it presented them"},{"bs":"bio je izložen","en":"he/it was presented"},{"bs":"i izložit ćemo","en":"and We will present"}],"ref":"18:48","answerWord":"وَعُرِضُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/275b9d1521faac49ce52.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And they are set before thy Lord in ranks (and it is said unto them): Now verily have ye come unto Us as We created you at the first. But ye thought that We had set no tryst for you.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokazati, izložiti, ponuditi","en":"to show, to present, to offer"},"passage":["وَعُرِضُوا۟","عَلَىٰ","رَبِّكَ","صَفًّا","لَّقَدْ","جِئْتُمُونَا","كَمَا","خَلَقْنَٰكُمْ","أَوَّلَ","مَرَّةٍۭ","بَلْ","زَعَمْتُمْ","أَلَّن","نَّجْعَلَ","لَكُم","مَّوْعِدًا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"عَرَضَ"}},{"id":"arada-3-18-100-0","words":["verb:arada-3"],"options":[{"bs":"i izložit ćemo","en":"and We will present"},{"bs":"i bili su izloženi","en":"and they were presented"},{"bs":"izloženi ste","en":"you (all) are presented"},{"bs":"bio je izložen","en":"he/it was presented"}],"ref":"18:100","answerWord":"وَعَرَضْنَا","answerSound":"audio/dcd08465a7d302bb7946.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"On that day we shall present hell to the disbelievers, plain to view,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokazati, izložiti, ponuditi","en":"to show, to present, to offer"},"passage":["وَعَرَضْنَا","جَهَنَّمَ","يَوْمَئِذٍ","لِّلْكَٰفِرِينَ","عَرْضًا"],"marked":[0],"facts":{"verb":"عَرَضَ"}},{"id":"arada-3-33-72-1","words":["verb:arada-3"],"options":[{"bs":"ponudili smo","en":"we offered"},{"bs":"izložio ih je","en":"he/it presented them"},{"bs":"bio je izložen","en":"he/it was presented"},{"bs":"i bili su izloženi","en":"and they were presented"}],"ref":"33:72","answerWord":"عَرَضْنَا","answerSound":"audio/1c19a7d56b341ff90ffb.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! We offered the trust unto the heavens and the earth and the hills, but they shrank from bearing it and were afraid of it. And man assumed it. Lo! he hath proved a tyrant and a fool.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokazati, izložiti, ponuditi","en":"to show, to present, to offer"},"passage":["إِنَّا","عَرَضْنَا","ٱلْأَمَانَةَ","عَلَى","ٱلسَّمَٰوَٰتِ","وَٱلْأَرْضِ","وَٱلْجِبَالِ","فَأَبَيْنَ","أَن","يَحْمِلْنَهَا","وَأَشْفَقْنَ","مِنْهَا","وَحَمَلَهَا","ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ","إِنَّهُۥ","كَانَ","ظَلُومًا","جَهُولًا"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"عَرَضَ"}},{"id":"arada-3-38-31-1","words":["verb:arada-3"],"options":[{"bs":"bio je izložen","en":"he/it was presented"},{"bs":"izložio ih je","en":"he/it presented them"},{"bs":"ponudili smo","en":"we offered"},{"bs":"izložen je","en":"he/it is presented"}],"ref":"38:31","answerWord":"عُرِضَ","answerSound":"audio/c4df08299f16e870bed9.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"When there were shown to him at eventide lightfooted coursers","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokazati, izložiti, ponuditi","en":"to show, to present, to offer"},"passage":["إِذْ","عُرِضَ","عَلَيْهِ","بِٱلْعَشِىِّ","ٱلصَّٰفِنَٰتُ","ٱلْجِيَادُ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"عَرَضَ"}},{"id":"arada-3-69-18-1","words":["verb:arada-3"],"options":[{"bs":"izloženi ste","en":"you (all) are presented"},{"bs":"izložen je","en":"he/it is presented"},{"bs":"ponudili smo","en":"we offered"},{"bs":"bio je izložen","en":"he/it was presented"}],"ref":"69:18","answerWord":"تُعْرَضُونَ","answerSound":"audio/ba5c2213cbf993e4f990.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"On that day ye will be exposed; not a secret of you will be hidden.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"pokazati, izložiti, ponuditi","en":"to show, to present, to offer"},"passage":["يَوْمَئِذٍ","تُعْرَضُونَ","لَا","تَخْفَىٰ","مِنكُمْ","خَافِيَةٌ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"عَرَضَ"}},{"id":"adda-2-4-58-4","words":["verb:adda-2"],"options":[{"bs":"predajete","en":"you (all) deliver"},{"bs":"predaje ga","en":"he/it delivers it"},{"bs":"pa neka preda","en":"so let him deliver"},{"bs":"predajte","en":"deliver (pl.)"}],"ref":"4:58","answerWord":"تُؤَدُّوا۟","answerSound":"audio/3dc80b22bf28e8f8fa58.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Lo! Allah commandeth you that ye restore deposits to their owners, and, if ye judge between mankind, that ye judge justly. Lo! comely is this which